<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IMPERIAL SIGNS MOZAMBIQUE CAR RENTAL DEAL.</title>
<headline>IMPERIAL SIGNS MOZAMBIQUE CAR RENTAL DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Car Rental, a division of Imperial Holdings Ltd , announced on Thursday it had signed a licensing agreement with a Mozambican car rental company.</p>
<p>In terms of the agreement, Plus Rent A Car Mozambique would operate as Imperial Car Rental with a fleet of 50 vehicles servicing the tourist and business sectors of the market.</p>
<p>Imperial already has branches in South Africa, Botswana, Namibia and Swaziland.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
